SUMMARY:Casual Linkup@bitcircus101 (4FR)
DESCRIPTION:A relaxed get-together for techies\, creatives\, and curious mi
 nds in the heart of Bonn. Drop by for a chat\, a drink\, or just to unwind
 . https://bitcircus101.de
